    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d553-a10">

                <pb facs="0919" n="783" sameAs="frus:frus1888p1/pg783"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 10.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The German consul-general to the American
                        consul-general.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Imperial German Consulate for the South Sea Islands</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Apia</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1887-08-14"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >August</hi> 14, 1887</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In answer to your letter of the 13th
                    August, and with reference to our conversation of yesterday, I have the honor to
                    inform you that I can not assist at any meeting of the municipal court of appeal
                    concerning the case of “Gurr <hi rendition="#italic">v</hi>. Marquardt.”</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Becker</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
